# CarPlay Route Input Implementation

**Date:** 2026-08-10  
**Type:** Feature Implementation  
**Status:** Complete

## Context

Implemented a comprehensive Google Maps-style route input interface for CarPlay simulation with advanced features including voice search, saved places management, search history, and route preview functionality.

## Problem

The existing CarPlay simulation lacked a modern, user-friendly route input interface. Users needed a way to:
- Input start and destination locations efficiently
- Access frequently used locations quickly
- Get route information before starting navigation
- Use voice commands for hands-free operation
- Save and manage favorite locations

## Solution

Implemented a complete route input system with the following features:

### Core Features

1. **Google Maps-Style Dark Theme**
   - Dark background (#1c1c1e) with rounded corners (16px)
   - Clean header with close button and saved places access
   - Start and destination input fields with icons
   - Action buttons for navigation

2. **Voice Search Integration**
   - Web Speech API integration (SpeechRecognition/webkitSpeechRecognition)
   - Voice search buttons (🎤) on both input fields
   - Visual feedback during listening (red button with pulse animation)
   - Automatic population of input field with recognized speech
   - Comprehensive error handling (no speech, permission denied, network errors)

3. **Saved Places Management**
   - Saved places button (★) in route input header
   - Full-screen modal with dark theme styling
   - localStorage persistence for saved locations
   - Save/remove buttons on each suggestion item
   - Quick access to use saved places directly in route input
   - Empty state with helpful message when no places saved

4. **Search History**
   - Automatic tracking of recently searched locations
   - Timestamps for when locations were last used
   - Relative time display (e.g., "5m ago", "2h ago", "1d ago")
   - localStorage persistence
   - Clear history button
   - Maximum 10 history items maintained

5. **Route Preview**
   - Distance calculation using Haversine formula
   - Time estimation based on route type and distance
   - Different average speeds for each route option:
     - Fastest: 50 km/h (mixed city/highway)
     - Shortest: 40 km/h (slower routes)
     - Avoid Tolls: 45 km/h (slightly slower)
   - Dynamic preview updates when locations are selected
   - Route options (Fastest, Shortest, Avoid Tolls)

6. **Enhanced UI/UX**
   - Clear (X) buttons for input fields
   - Contextual placeholder text ("Where from?", "Where to?")
   - Quick action buttons (Home, Work, Gym)
   - Category headers with item counts
   - Improved touch targets (44-56px minimum)
   - Better spacing and padding
   - Skeleton loading animations

7. **Location Suggestions**
   - Organized by categories (Favorites, Recent, Nearby)
   - Icon mapping system for different location types
   - Real-world locations (restaurants, gas stations, parks, etc.)
   - Work-related locations (conference rooms, break areas)
   - Personal favorites (gym, favorite restaurants)

