### Key Functions

**Voice Search:**
- `initVoiceRecognition()` - Initialize speech recognition
- `startVoiceSearch(field)` - Start voice recognition for specific field
- `stopVoiceSearch()` - Stop active voice recognition
- `updateVoiceButtonState(isListening)` - Update button visual state
- `handleVoiceResult(transcript)` - Process recognized speech

**Saved Places:**
- `loadSavedPlaces()` - Load from localStorage
- `saveSavedPlaces(places)` - Save to localStorage
- `isLocationSaved(locationId)` - Check if location is saved
- `saveLocation(location)` - Add location to saved places
- `removeLocation(locationId)` - Remove from saved places
- `openSavedPlaces()` - Open saved places modal
- `closeSavedPlaces()` - Close modal
- `loadSavedPlacesContent()` - Render saved places list
- `useSavedPlace(locationId)` - Use saved place in route input
- `removeSavedPlace(locationId)` - Remove with confirmation
- `toggleSaveLocation(locationId)` - Toggle save state

**Search History:**
- `loadSearchHistory()` - Load from localStorage
- `saveSearchHistory(history)` - Save to localStorage
- `addToSearchHistory(location)` - Add location with timestamp
- `clearSearchHistory()` - Clear all history
- `formatTimestamp(timestamp)` - Convert timestamp to relative time

**Route Preview:**
- `calculateDistance(lat1, lon1, lat2, lon2)` - Haversine formula
- `estimateTime(distance, routeOption)` - Time estimation
- `updateRoutePreview()` - Update preview display
- `selectRouteOption(option)` - Change route type

